//! **Large is 190 km wide, not a round 400, and that is a measured choice.**
//! `seaFrac` is `seaHits/n` over that box, so it is quantised; at a 25-cell
//! box the smallest value above `0.02` is `0.04`, and mutating
//! `_umSiteKindFromTerrain`'s `0.02` to `0.03` is unobservable **by
//! construction** however many probes are swept. At 121 cells the quantum is
