//! 2026-09-02, a 22-mutant sweep over every constant below, all killed).
//!
//! The probe that pins `0.02` is `Large (118, 283)`, and it is the **only**
//! one in the whole sweep whose `seaFrac` lands in `(0.02, 0.03]` -- `3/110`,
//! not `3/121`, because the sample box is clipped at the grid edge. The
//! capture's retention rule keys on the quotient for exactly that reason; see
//! `seaFracAt` there.
